 0030   0006    '----- SCRLTEST.BAS: hardware scrolling probe for the 486's Cir
                rus Logic card.
 0030   0006    '----- The Cirrus VBE 1.2 BIOS says "ok" to INT 10h 4F07h (set 
                display start) but
 0030   0006    '----- the picture does not move (VGA.LOG of 2026-09-13). This 
                test scrolls the
 0030   0006    '----- 640x480x256 two-page screen (1024-byte pitch, page 1 at 
                VRAM line 480) four
 0030   0006    '----- ways and logs the CRTC registers after each, so the log 
                shows what the BIOS
 0030   0006    '----- really wrote and the viewer at the monitor sees which me
                thod moves the
 0030   0006    '----- picture:
 0030   0006    '-----   phase 1 (one square top-left)    VESA 4F07h,   0 -> 48
                0 -> 0 lines
 0030   0006    '-----   phase 2 (two squares)            direct CRTC,  0 -> 48
                0 -> 0 lines
 0030   0006    '-----   phase 3 (three squares)          direct CRTC,  sideway
                s 0 -> 384 -> 0 px
 0030   0006    '-----   phase 4 (four squares)           direct CRTC,  4 fast 
                up/down cycles (timed)
 0030   0006    '----- Direct CRTC = CR0C/CR0D (start address, in the mode's by
                te/word/dword unit,
 0030   0006    '----- read from CR14 bit 6 / CR17 bit 6) + Cirrus CR1B bits 0,
                2,3 = address bits
 0030   0006    '----- 16,17,18 (+ CR1D bit 7 = bit 19 on GD5430 and later). Ci
                rrus extensions are
 0030   0006    '----- unlocked with SR06 = 12h (reads back 12h; any other valu
                e locks, reads 0Fh);
 0030   0006    '----- CR27 bits 7-2 = chip id (98h = GD5428, 9Ch = GD5429, A0h
                 = GD5430,
 0030   0006    '----- A8h = GD5434, ACh = GD5436, B8h = GD5446).
 0030   0006    '----- Page 0 = colour bands + a white row marker every 60 line
                s (n ticks = n*60),
 0030   0006    '----- page 1 = the same bands shifted by 8 colours + black mar
                kers, so a scroll
 0030   0006    '----- from page 0 to page 1 is obvious. Writes SCRLTEST.LOG, a
                uto-exits (~25 s).
 0030   0006    '----- Build/run: src\tools\scrltest.conf (DOSBox-X: proves pha
                ses 1 and 2 on S3).
 0030   0006    DEFINT A-Z
 0030   0006    '$INCLUDE: 'UGL.BI'
 0030   0006    ''
 0030   0006    '' ugl.bi -- UGL routines
 0030   0006    ''
 0030   0006    
 0030   0006    Const UGL.TRUE%     = -1%
 0030   0006    Const UGL.FALSE%    = 0%
 0030   0006    
 0030   0006    Const DCTSIZE%      = 64%
 0030   0006    '' dc types:
 0030   0006    Const UGL.MEM%      = 0% * DCTSIZE%
 0030   0006    Const UGL.BNK%      = 1% * DCTSIZE%
 0030   0006    Const UGL.EMS%      = 2% * DCTSIZE%
